## Project-Specific Rules

### Seeders
- Required non-nullable columns without DB defaults must be provided in seeders.
- When models use file upload traits, seeders should use `DB::table()` inserts with known string paths — do not rely on trait methods that expect `UploadedFile` instances.
- Translated seeders: insert parent row first, then batch-insert all locale rows in a single `->insert([])` call.

### Eager loading
- Dashboard index/show services must eager-load all relations rendered in views.
- Use model-level `public const RELATIONS` to declare relationships needed in admin pages.